  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher probability of shipping disruptions raises counterparties' operational and settlement risk and pushes up insurance and margin costs, causing dealers to pull back inventories and widen bid‑ask spreads, reducing bond market liquidity.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">middle_east_escalation</data>
  <data key="d39">global_financial_stress</data>
