  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher risk to shipping in key Middle East chokepoints (e.g., Red Sea, Suez approaches) forces rerouting, longer voyages and port congestion that directly cut available shipping capacity and scheduled throughput on commercial corridors serving the Russia–Ukraine theatre.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">middle_east_escalation</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
