  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Attacks and heightened risk in chokepoints force rerouting, port suspensions and insurance refusals that immediately delay, degrade or cancel shipments of time‑sensitive critical inputs (specialty chemicals, gases, components), reducing effective access and diversity of supply.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">middle_east_escalation</data>
  <data key="d39">security_alliance_shift</data>
