  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">A fast build‑out of data‑centre capacity increases near‑term demand for copper, power equipment, cooling hardware and associated inputs, straining local availability and reducing the security/diversity of critical materials supply.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
