  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Tighter export controls and investment-screening rules immediately block or delay inbound/outbound deals and announced cross-border transactions in the tech sector, causing an observable drop in net cross-border capital flows.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
