  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">1</data>
  <data key="d35">0.55</data>
  <data key="d36">Stricter export and data‑flow restrictions push firms to reroute and obscure supply chains via longer or less transparent maritime routes through chokepoints (and via third‑country hubs), increasing exposure to interdiction, misidentification and opportunistic attacks in the Red Sea and nearby sea lanes.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">middle_east_escalation</data>
