  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Tightened export controls and service‑denial rules in the US/partner jurisdictions force satellite operators and component suppliers to suspend sales or block accounts linked to Russian users, directly reducing civilian/military satcom availability for Russian forces and customers.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
