  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">A shift in alliances that raises tariffs on key trade corridors increases earnings uncertainty for multinationals and commodity flows, provoking rapid portfolio rebalancing and spike trading activity that elevates market volatility.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">security_alliance_shift</data>
