  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher tariffs on imported servers, storage, GPUs and networking equipment increase procurement costs and lead times for cloud and enterprise buyers, prompting firms to delay or downscale AI infrastructure investments.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">security_alliance_shift</data>
