  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">An alliance shift that triggers export controls or supplier exclusion for strategic inputs produces immediate import shortages and higher input prices, pushing up government emergency import financing and risk premia and thereby raising sovereign bond yields within weeks.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">security_alliance_shift</data>
  <data key="d39">global_financial_stress</data>
