  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Improved security and diversity of supply for strategic inputs (munitions components, sensors, electronics) allows regional actors and their proxies to rearm and sustain operations, increasing the scale and frequency of kinetic actions.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">security_alliance_shift</data>
  <data key="d39">middle_east_escalation</data>
