  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Deterioration in access to critical components (RF modules, power electronics, specialized chips) constrains production and repair of commercial satellite terminals and ground stations used in-theater, reducing operational bandwidth and reliability for military and civilian users.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">security_alliance_shift</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
